-            used for actor/policy optimization. See Soft Actor-Critic and
-            Applications.
-        qf2 (garage.torch.q_function.ContinuousMLPQFunction): QFunction/Critic
-            used for actor/policy optimization. See Soft Actor-Critic and
-            Applications.
